  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "孩子们所盼望的，过年过节之外，大概要数迎神赛会的时候了。",
      "output_sha256": "2ce5301cc21ad3b5065af9418b79accf3245df0445ab8db7d646e14a6ed0f4ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ce5301cc21ad3b5065af9418b79accf3245df0445ab8db7d646e14a6ed0f4ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我家的所在很偏僻，待到赛会的行列经过时，一定已在下午，仪仗之类，也减而又减，所剩的极其寥寥。",
      "output_sha256": "5bef649bbe15024ba06db07f00e7d783e1dde7a64d01f1f280b17333f16fcebf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "5bef649bbe15024ba06db07f00e7d783e1dde7a64d01f1f280b17333f16fcebf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "往往伸著颈子等候多时，却只见十几个人抬著一个金脸或蓝脸红脸的神像匆匆地跑过去。",
      "output_sha256": "32fb680617ca625e97a87415dc502fb7e5c11d3e4a96b2668273efb58e6d9948",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "32fb680617ca625e97a87415dc502fb7e5c11d3e4a96b2668273efb58e6d9948",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是，完了。",
      "output_sha256": "4148e1bfefff2e70c093c963aee96afd641fb56533aae3a1782fb39bdd9efbe9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "4148e1bfefff2e70c093c963aee96afd641fb56533aae3a1782fb39bdd9efbe9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我常存著这样的一个希望：这一次所见的赛会，比前一次繁盛些。",
      "output_sha256": "b233d448f036ebd9b87a8588142d38768e9ae18fbdc8f7fed0006acdd08a0e80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "b233d448f036ebd9b87a8588142d38768e9ae18fbdc8f7fed0006acdd08a0e80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是结果总是一个“差不多”；也总是只留下一个纪念品，就是当神像还未抬过之前，化一文钱买下的，用一点烂泥，一点颜色纸，一枝竹签和两三枝鸡毛所做的，吹起来会发出一种刺耳的声音的哨子，叫作“吹都都”的，吡吡地吹它两三天。",
      "output_sha256": "aa3d495b4602cb74fc2b12cd834ba156bcea1000e8de5875e5c96c245e278d90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa3d495b4602cb74fc2b12cd834ba156bcea1000e8de5875e5c96c245e278d90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在看看《陶庵梦忆》，觉得那时的赛会，真是豪奢极了，虽然明人的文章，怕难免有些夸大。",
      "output_sha256": "f4ffb1b01085e2f95887c5fba674a91e57b12b3182ae16ef8c9ce6f498d2327d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4ffb1b01085e2f95887c5fba674a91e57b12b3182ae16ef8c9ce6f498d2327d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今祷雨迎龙王的活动仍在，但方式已然简单，只有十几个人围着一条龙，村里的小孩扮演海鬼。",
      "output_sha256": "43aa83858a04c6d84a5e297c65558376e36cd0c138c057993cf8b387372ae449",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.436675,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c3cb471f75a84ca98b30675890699e532bcb7236cc9ed26eb0949dc062beeedb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "43aa83858a04c6d84a5e297c65558376e36cd0c138c057993cf8b387372ae449",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "彼时却有各种故事角色，实在是精彩纷呈。",
      "output_sha256": "f5713b7b692e1a3381b47911178cb7f679042fb7567c667d5fe07db1c791f2de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.414858,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1844c982dc40b60d1a688e37fb67b6a9a68dd449844901d322519c4997af946f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f5713b7b692e1a3381b47911178cb7f679042fb7567c667d5fe07db1c791f2de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他记扮《水浒传》中人物云：“……于是分头四出，寻黑矮汉，寻梢长大汉，寻头陀，寻胖大和尚，寻茁壮妇人，寻姣长妇人，寻青面，寻歪头，寻赤须，寻美髯，寻黑大汉，寻赤脸长须。",
      "output_sha256": "d1977bc620ddfedb2f5049f20340c111d49e853fd01fd4a0f217511ec41812b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1977bc620ddfedb2f5049f20340c111d49e853fd01fd4a0f217511ec41812b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大索城中；无，则之郭，之村，之山僻，之邻府州县。",
      "output_sha256": "7b38b4056bde85502d0344a2b0cdd1c7002917c79fe38126d1bb11ccb56a49d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b38b4056bde85502d0344a2b0cdd1c7002917c79fe38126d1bb11ccb56a49d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "用重价聘之，得三十六人，梁山泊好汉，个个呵活，臻臻至至，人马称娖而行……”这样的白描的活古人，谁能不动一看的雅兴呢？",
      "output_sha256": "5f339fad2028a53fb008d2ee2c4394c00787dea36a71043993e9f9e1b58bddae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f339fad2028a53fb008d2ee2c4394c00787dea36a71043993e9f9e1b58bddae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可惜这种盛举，早已和明社一同消灭了。",
      "output_sha256": "042de4ee23f03ab70bb25770b78dc0d5ab0425280e2f022485cf153b2c351925",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "042de4ee23f03ab70bb25770b78dc0d5ab0425280e2f022485cf153b2c351925",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "赛会虽然不象现在上海的旗袍，北京的谈国事，为当局所禁止，然而妇孺们是不许看的，读书人即所谓士子，也大抵不肯赶去看。",
      "output_sha256": "bd6b19330c23d8ba10f476e8865ca8a9b73a086b58b5b1c793ba3334ff3464ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd6b19330c23d8ba10f476e8865ca8a9b73a086b58b5b1c793ba3334ff3464ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只有游手好闲的闲人，这才跑到庙前或衙门前去看热闹；我关于赛会的知识，多半是从他们的叙述上得来的，并非考据家所贵重的“眼学”。",
      "output_sha256": "3f37ceee8e743d1ad82db16bb1de12395e66632d4882e61cd6599984129378a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f37ceee8e743d1ad82db16bb1de12395e66632d4882e61cd6599984129378a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过我记得有一回，亲眼见过较为盛大的赛会。",
      "output_sha256": "ca968992ad16f659e859d70a4348e3c461670daba232df897bb68c8916f499df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.623707,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f5c599cd1a6377d20eb17c6813db61c3eddd2ae15768066c323f8314785d1983"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ca968992ad16f659e859d70a4348e3c461670daba232df897bb68c8916f499df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "开首是一个孩子骑马先来，称为“塘报”；过了许久，“高照”到了，长竹竿揭起一条很长的旗，一个汗流浃背的胖大汉用两手托著；他高兴的时候，就肯将竿头放在头顶或牙齿上，甚而至于鼻尖。",
      "output_sha256": "a9f86114597bd40aa5ea83f0d94788655cbbf24865f086217d23a80c3174cd1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9f86114597bd40aa5ea83f0d94788655cbbf24865f086217d23a80c3174cd1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接下来便是“高跷”、“抬阁”、“马头”等表演，还有扮演犯人的，红衣枷锁中也有孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "f02fafe63fc472048e6dbd3e2065c4e4972f88840024f9babaf254ec63ae18f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.683815,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d228b0d8acee02688869d9d285360e40777582aac3116d086159cdef925906a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f02fafe63fc472048e6dbd3e2065c4e4972f88840024f9babaf254ec63ae18f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我那时觉得这些都是有光荣的事业，与闻其事的即全是大有运气的人，——大概羡慕他们的出风头罢。",
      "output_sha256": "585fda1dba931d323688f792349047c0446064ef95cdc54b64ba963a12beb17c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "585fda1dba931d323688f792349047c0446064ef95cdc54b64ba963a12beb17c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想，我为什么不生一场重病，使我的母亲也好到庙里去许下一个“扮犯人”的心愿的呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b768b4207590245c29cf06c4a0f2b12eabc63aba410a94692c204e2267e79be8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "b768b4207590245c29cf06c4a0f2b12eabc63aba410a94692c204e2267e79be8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而直到现在，我与赛会仍无缘。",
      "output_sha256": "c6cc5e1d4df3cb4f293b745112fe028f37c8a275c23dc5f18e81bf68ab85a8bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.42067,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3c7a1b5a4a8254e3157b45fd99089d9192c4a065e4f24cab1b62a8a688dff80c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6cc5e1d4df3cb4f293b745112fe028f37c8a275c23dc5f18e81bf68ab85a8bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我打算去东关看五猖会。",
      "output_sha256": "d39b011c9b77ad4cfcda683ba480eb41c604a87cd4ec46dc27ec87140cdca19b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.610385,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f0cbc85d2a0344eeba1a01d2d07e2729b9eb6d6d67ba20b463a3d77bfc5e4aab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d39b011c9b77ad4cfcda683ba480eb41c604a87cd4ec46dc27ec87140cdca19b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是我儿时难得的盛事，因为那是全县最盛大的会，东关离我家又远，出城还有六十多里的水路，那里有两座独特的庙宇。",
      "output_sha256": "77b69a5fcef2b1eba1914ed07e4d519d5722a2c56e74e4d484279a22d07ae765",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.669534,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "64f112c9724794aded0609a0998677705bff5c71a1839bf87536d4fc52316325"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "77b69a5fcef2b1eba1914ed07e4d519d5722a2c56e74e4d484279a22d07ae765",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一座是梅姑庙，正是《聊斋志异》中记载的，守节的室女死后成神，却又篡取他人的丈夫；如今神座上塑有一对少年男女，笑容满面，与“礼教”相悖。",
      "output_sha256": "c50d24cf82c0cbf74369b60eb625427b5dc6e821b03b107e157bfdd61299e83a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.623888,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "184fe5390b8d5515c43a4fb392d63d5c32a7a168877ea1d2ae9c65b4463e602d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c50d24cf82c0cbf74369b60eb625427b5dc6e821b03b107e157bfdd61299e83a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其一便是五猖庙了，名目就奇特。",
      "output_sha256": "376e122cea2af57cdc0c4761a26d33a825c26844d4c14f757490444c171dc384",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "376e122cea2af57cdc0c4761a26d33a825c26844d4c14f757490444c171dc384",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "据考据者所言，这就是五通神，但并无确切依据。",
      "output_sha256": "8e5ce4a999d3adf8ebe250e9fe7fcaf10c5deda7c28b31631b4533650a57e839",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.578452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "35f21025cd7bda64e06bf61f2dc14827d22173c4838a576a798502ec7f10fe24",
        "d970a7ea8ce69b5418cb8ac22bef037329cd160df12df44450ccec74e0f411c9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8e5ce4a999d3adf8ebe250e9fe7fcaf10c5deda7c28b31631b4533650a57e839",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "神像是五个男人，也不见有什么猖獗之状；后面列坐著五位太太，却并不“分坐”，远不及北京戏园里界限之谨严。",
      "output_sha256": "c71b1738a8c3a54286e44cf475c459be67d37874ba2894f4a32286fcb75dd8a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "c71b1738a8c3a54286e44cf475c459be67d37874ba2894f4a32286fcb75dd8a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其实呢，这也是殊与“礼教”有妨的，——但他们既然是五猖，便也无法可想，而且自然也就“又作别论”了。",
      "output_sha256": "fd6e00bd9c9f09f4ebecbd655261ffcc12d49a0cc146e423e36f6de81f52bce7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd6e00bd9c9f09f4ebecbd655261ffcc12d49a0cc146e423e36f6de81f52bce7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "由于东关离城较远，大家清晨便早早起床。",
      "output_sha256": "ba7663d9b1e87d1b01ae1d76392e4253653fa23d4bfeb0a0345bbc38f1edf6f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.514596,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2252f7bcd6a90a644fcad58aea4a765fa4e134e487f3cc973668b2cd435bbc0f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba7663d9b1e87d1b01ae1d76392e4253653fa23d4bfeb0a0345bbc38f1edf6f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昨夜预定好的三道明瓦窗的大船，已经泊在河埠头，船椅、饭菜、茶炊、点心盒子，都在陆续搬下去了。",
      "output_sha256": "922b3e729010f5ab69413a722634521fa6da19c9ae90681ae28b0c77685f478a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "922b3e729010f5ab69413a722634521fa6da19c9ae90681ae28b0c77685f478a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我欢笑着催促他们快些。",
      "output_sha256": "a6d44604b83de92c27d3371b991ac98aeb98c26503e2dbece64f0e5aeb871e14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.452911,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9a0db24eb9a0f8ba1b695030b76697b6560594fb2c5215f6a7212c25022c6b4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6d44604b83de92c27d3371b991ac98aeb98c26503e2dbece64f0e5aeb871e14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "忽然，工人的脸色变得严肃，我心中一紧，四周一看，父亲正站在我身后。",
      "output_sha256": "757bf1cd0bd6404997f873580062f01ecd6c1a728f720ea7e91b39a5893041d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.56431,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "afb90ffbbb40a3c773fea190331d1426064157bb4e2d35d7534189cd27ae1f10"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "757bf1cd0bd6404997f873580062f01ecd6c1a728f720ea7e91b39a5893041d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“去拿你的书来。”",
      "output_sha256": "fc2158f40881e73d5252820dd80cf22a617601b38b57a33960f8ca55d13de09d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc2158f40881e73d5252820dd80cf22a617601b38b57a33960f8ca55d13de09d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他慢慢地说。",
      "output_sha256": "fc2bad4f2e192bbacb4dbac93f27f8a0dabd55f793d7b95c86f8575458460f37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc2bad4f2e192bbacb4dbac93f27f8a0dabd55f793d7b95c86f8575458460f37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这所谓“书”，是指我开蒙时候所读的《鉴略》，因为我再没有第二本了。",
      "output_sha256": "216e5e7ace77a9573362edb93bb692f89ed54858dae4453eb3371ff99cc203c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "216e5e7ace77a9573362edb93bb692f89ed54858dae4453eb3371ff99cc203c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们那里上学的年龄多是单数，所以我记得那时我七岁。",
      "output_sha256": "edb72e360d6f3ff87a2c63c29f32ca8b03369c8827165f700218695aca6d5e71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.566209,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1e1957016d72ec82df60caefac0ae269ba0610a64561ef982f03b0dbd88b32d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "edb72e360d6f3ff87a2c63c29f32ca8b03369c8827165f700218695aca6d5e71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我心中忐忑，拿来了书。",
      "output_sha256": "e06556437d07aa8097e326cbfda2a9d286ea98fe5fe754ffc493ac32589d607b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.594231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d421ea284d7e4ed9499fcb1afcb363d30c8706934b3412e748de29fa6680eaf7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e06556437d07aa8097e326cbfda2a9d286ea98fe5fe754ffc493ac32589d607b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他使我同坐在堂中央的桌子前，教我一句一句地读下去。",
      "output_sha256": "171020076677d24c0bfc389d39fc757f63dbc55bca97701094be2a784eebec93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "171020076677d24c0bfc389d39fc757f63dbc55bca97701094be2a784eebec93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我担著心，一句一句地读下去。",
      "output_sha256": "fe95402608981ef772001cc40e21acf6aa77af8aa038011ba98500bfc66b2aaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "fe95402608981ef772001cc40e21acf6aa77af8aa038011ba98500bfc66b2aaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "读了二三十行后，他说：“给我读熟。",
      "output_sha256": "76f94a5568150bcf69b3f3025111be656e242b60ef2b0e59e2ec34960127b273",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.649342,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41,
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "90bd99084b2244182ff59eb6be8d3692588bccf80dd733a67571c470e92cdb52",
        "5d30bc6f10bf089fa0d888b47671571d1f549086a8b53a9664db019cc1b70b98"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "76f94a5568150bcf69b3f3025111be656e242b60ef2b0e59e2ec34960127b273",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "背不出，就不准去看会。”",
      "output_sha256": "7827bad11cf6e24debaacb3ea051c07685aa0b9c57706a398f151e796577d2dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "7827bad11cf6e24debaacb3ea051c07685aa0b9c57706a398f151e796577d2dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他说完，便站起来，走进房里去了。",
      "output_sha256": "1f6381193edd70f7ac0e57ed03b6dd1f9bbe6af458184e50ac87bc4105d36768",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f6381193edd70f7ac0e57ed03b6dd1f9bbe6af458184e50ac87bc4105d36768",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我似乎从头上浇了一盆冷水。",
      "output_sha256": "3ab2e193c2141d7007cab756a609326cdd768232bdfa24b2ff8a7ab308a65a5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ab2e193c2141d7007cab756a609326cdd768232bdfa24b2ff8a7ab308a65a5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是，有什么法子呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b8ec0687fc33848b9c51f34c315c53c64e44d3bbb3e2ba40a57e149a41320402",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8ec0687fc33848b9c51f34c315c53c64e44d3bbb3e2ba40a57e149a41320402",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自然是读著，读著，强记著，——而且要背出来。",
      "output_sha256": "5c215c414813d8608f2bc9aaffd5a6a8646c14d2da684a01a8ddd43a1f92c3b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c215c414813d8608f2bc9aaffd5a6a8646c14d2da684a01a8ddd43a1f92c3b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "粤自盘古，生于太荒，",
      "output_sha256": "848f6ddea2215da19c7246e1b75928ff804a0626f0ca67016cd1658d8dbf1eb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "848f6ddea2215da19c7246e1b75928ff804a0626f0ca67016cd1658d8dbf1eb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "首出御世，肇开混茫。",
      "output_sha256": "89d1a044dd6714cc474df8f16ccaa3e4b7c1251941565249c225ad6a7f5366bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "89d1a044dd6714cc474df8f16ccaa3e4b7c1251941565249c225ad6a7f5366bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这样的书，我现在只记得前四句，其他的都忘记了；那时所强记的二三十行，自然也随着忘却了。",
      "output_sha256": "f10b92307daac81fc75cac5a60086119ea3e4ceb034c82414c844fbd925d48be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.758452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a00cdb2f51cb15497411f535c7c41aa3ab05272147ae1ee6aa10a1f2521e7d2e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f10b92307daac81fc75cac5a60086119ea3e4ceb034c82414c844fbd925d48be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "记得那时听人说，读《鉴略》比读《千字文》、《百家姓》有用得多，因为可以知道从古到今的大概。",
      "output_sha256": "701df2974154b579bf8e5253b1501ea5fd40a9930e29454f2d2f93e40b276936",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "701df2974154b579bf8e5253b1501ea5fd40a9930e29454f2d2f93e40b276936",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "知道从古到今的大概，那当然是很好的，然而我一字也不懂。",
      "output_sha256": "52a76bab3b5c58aa3d41986d32275451110662e4923a761db6ea6fab88e48b21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "52a76bab3b5c58aa3d41986d32275451110662e4923a761db6ea6fab88e48b21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“粤自盘古”就是“粤自盘古”，读下去，记住它，“粤自盘古”呵！",
      "output_sha256": "ef55d5287210a953f25b040078d90e10725812f0dab1bac1f4fdf154affef04e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef55d5287210a953f25b040078d90e10725812f0dab1bac1f4fdf154affef04e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“生于太荒”呵！",
      "output_sha256": "821cf40dfd10c174220130c78d79e77aca2cca8553ef4b3678bd8925395d9ac0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "821cf40dfd10c174220130c78d79e77aca2cca8553ef4b3678bd8925395d9ac0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……",
      "output_sha256": "a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "应用的物件已经搬完，家中由忙乱转成静肃了。",
      "output_sha256": "bff0d37d4881fdf870a30a3db6121fd56600fe2b05be8df5220f04da210d920b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "bff0d37d4881fdf870a30a3db6121fd56600fe2b05be8df5220f04da210d920b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "朝阳照耀着西墙，天气清朗。",
      "output_sha256": "8b6d90ce4d4e63ac16b00affa58e6d04532d730f38bacebfacb8df95b3175dd9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.721753,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3aa7199f8e061789a46f19e113e24e466a306af187fcb9ef205fdc90a4bbe67e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b6d90ce4d4e63ac16b00affa58e6d04532d730f38bacebfacb8df95b3175dd9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "母亲、工人、长妈妈即阿长，都无法营救，只默默地静候著我读熟，而且背出来。",
      "output_sha256": "2a832add67bfcc52b42789f35e4dc32e4595eabc3325f669b1579f391252cde3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a832add67bfcc52b42789f35e4dc32e4595eabc3325f669b1579f391252cde3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这静谧中，我似乎要用铁钳将“生于太荒”之类的句子夹住；也听到自己急促的诵读声颤抖着，仿佛深秋的蟋蟀在夜间鸣叫。",
      "output_sha256": "21e33abe562ee7be3c99b15e09d1912b40083fc9434ba55bb4b845ab09510e6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.626213,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "04b8fb922ef02b0fca9889bc71064c0bd21343d6d48d273b19aa69fa41256c91"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "21e33abe562ee7be3c99b15e09d1912b40083fc9434ba55bb4b845ab09510e6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们都等候著；太阳也升得更高了。",
      "output_sha256": "0f2fe29534451d86f9cd4a82a552458493fa8518ff22f4d222932b097211bdb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f2fe29534451d86f9cd4a82a552458493fa8518ff22f4d222932b097211bdb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我忽然似乎已经很有把握，便即站了起来，拿书走进父亲的书房，一气背将下去，梦似的就背完了。",
      "output_sha256": "0d37a57717e0e78f5b1d6f774d929dcecb4f38a7b24168232179cc79828128cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d37a57717e0e78f5b1d6f774d929dcecb4f38a7b24168232179cc79828128cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“不错。",
      "output_sha256": "a5f06ec4b2df344a94df11e3bb52cc82466433fac0f5ca721130c5ab9c1e3810",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5f06ec4b2df344a94df11e3bb52cc82466433fac0f5ca721130c5ab9c1e3810",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "去罢。”",
      "output_sha256": "fec487cb9ebb32761867dd2d120699286f3d72c4415d2e99eb4f7ce12fb922cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
