      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家同时活动起来，脸上都露出笑容，向河埠走去。",
      "output_sha256": "e8a9d1d1a4294d1496107c00946369564f63a5d19d30890d278fb0af04a5ef3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "e8a9d1d1a4294d1496107c00946369564f63a5d19d30890d278fb0af04a5ef3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "工人将我高高抱起，似乎在祝贺我的成功，快步走在前面。",
      "output_sha256": "4872b32bedf7c23b997188a187f2dd835937ce0a40057ae90c7d026e1e451c21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.691734,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
