      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4872b32bedf7c23b997188a187f2dd835937ce0a40057ae90c7d026e1e451c21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我却并没有他们那么高兴。",
      "output_sha256": "198388ee04392c723d628818fc63ec6b65222ac687a9e18dccf0102e102423c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "198388ee04392c723d628818fc63ec6b65222ac687a9e18dccf0102e102423c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "开船后，水路的风景、点心盒里的美味，以及抵达东关的五猖会热闹，对于我似乎都没有什么特别的意义。",
      "output_sha256": "95ace547223d072c94848ef34255e06daddd3a3b92409e7d18df903532108462",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.691995,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
