      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "95ace547223d072c94848ef34255e06daddd3a3b92409e7d18df903532108462",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "直到现在，其他的事情早已忘却，不留任何痕迹，唯有那段背诵《鉴略》的经历，却依然清晰如昨日。",
      "output_sha256": "c014562d5450a0c804c619bdf0301c9e011ec80369dae123f5f94ef48249008f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.516016,
